sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Builder agent
    participant L as HoH ledger
    participant R as Fresh reviewer
    participant M as Cammut
    B->>L: hoh_propose (checks and probes, fixed in advance)
    B->>B: build and probe
    B->>L: hoh_freeze (file hashes)
    R->>R: re-run every check and probe on the frozen files
    R->>L: hoh_gate (exit codes, excerpts, findings)
    L-->>R: accepted or unmet
    L->>M: verdict written automatically
    B->>M: retain lessons (lesson:area)
    Note over B,R: The gate rejects the agent that froze the candidate
    alt accepted
        R-->>B: done
    else unmet
        R-->>B: fix and freeze again
    end
